These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | BLOCKING | lib/src/tools/load_modes.dart | 🚨 blocking the default partition defers config — the self config subsystem is broken and the pty cli integration ci shard is red 3 tests config is absent from the keep 12 essentialtoolnamesbyloadmode this line and from conditionalcapabilitytoolnames so the default partition demotes it into discoverablenames lib src tools availability dart and toolavailabilitygate wrapexecutor lib src tools availability gate dart 290 tombstones every direct config call with deferred not loaded — call others … before it reaches the executor that breaks the self config contract issue 29 s4 the self settings skill prompts skills self settings skill md declares config in allowed tools and mandates a config check op after every edit its scripted acceptance suite test integration self config e2e test dart unchanged by this pr drives config as the first call of every scenario — now tombstoned nothing lands ci on this head run 45630982662 commit f2ded7ec pty cli integration linux shard 0 3 — 67 passed 3 failed ac4 test integration self config e2e test dart 122 — the project config file is never created expected true actual false ac5 test integration self config e2e test dart 193 — tools web search false is never written actual — the file is empty ac6 test integration self config e2e test dart 285 — customproviders is empty expected an object with length of 1 actual both ac4 and ac5 were reproduced locally on this head with the identical signatures the mechanism is confirmed green side too the rewritten test cli load mode cli test dart pins the boot contract where config is deferred and the parity test pins config in the stub s 18 deferred names — so the demotion is deliberate per the goal 28 card but its collision with the self config subsystem was missed a real model can recover via others one extra round trip per session but every scripted automation consumer of the cli harness and the skill s documented flow break — and the suite is